                <p>Source: Department of State, Secretary’s Memoranda of Conversation: Lot 64 D 199. Secret. Drafted by
                    Dulles. Heuss and Brentano were in Washington June 4–7 on a
                    State visit. The meeting was held at the German Embassy.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d310-f2" n="1" xml:id="d310-f2-content">
                <p>May 7–15.</p>
